<title>USA: NCAA-MEN'S COLLEGE BASKETBALL TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>NCAA-MEN'S COLLEGE BASKETBALL TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second-round results in the</p>
<p>1997 NCAA men's college basketball tournament Sunday (prefix</p>
<p>number denotes regional seeding):</p>
<p>East Region (at Pittsburgh)</p>
<p>  6-Louisville	   64   3-New Mexico	63</p>
<p> 15-Coppin State	 vs  10-Texas</p>
<p>Southeast Region (at Charlotte)</p>
<p> 14-Tenn. Chattanooga  75   6-Illinois	  63</p>
<p> 10-Providence	   98   2-Duke		87</p>
<p>Midwest Region (at Kansas City)</p>
<p>  4-Clemson		65   5-Tulsa	     59</p>
<p>  9-Temple		 vs   1-Minnesota</p>
<p>West Region (at Tucson)</p>
<p>  2-Utah		   77   7-NC Charlotte    58</p>
<p>  6-Stanford	     vs   3-Wake Forest</p>
</text>
